# Dex vault — first assistant message in every NEW chat (non-negotiable)

Keep this file as a minimal fallback only.

- The first line of the first reply must be exactly `Session bootstrap:`.
- Do not put greetings, filler, or any text before it.
- After the bootstrap block, print the Karpathy echo block required by `.cursor/rules/session-bootstrap-enforcer.mdc`.
- Full contract, recovery policy, and proof requirements live in `.cursor/rules/session-bootstrap-enforcer.mdc`.
- If hooks do not run, check Cursor Settings -> Workspace Trust.
